# Regression for the unarchive-vm Step-1 ssh payload (vm-205 incident): the
# remote branch of on_storage executes payloads as stdin scripts in a fresh
# shell ("ssh ... bash -s", payload on stdin, positional args after -s).
# The suite's hostname stubs normally force the local (source-a-file)
# branch, so the stdin execution mode went untested and the payload's first
# top-level log_msg aborted with "BASH_SOURCE[1]: unbound variable".  This
